  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1768504162_4754279_5f18426ba537969ca984587755b62ba0.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <span style=\"color:rgb(9,9,11);font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Oryco Inc. is a Los Angeles–based, Food-ingredient distributor focused on Himalayan pink salt, and black Himalayan salt. The site emphasizes purity, sustainability and supplying foodservice, industrial and retail customers</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <span style=\"color:rgb(9,9,11);font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Product lineup includes fine, coarse and ground Himalayan pink salt, black (vegan) Himalayan salt, grinders/shakers, and bulk.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(9,9,11);font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">M<span style=\"color:rgb(9,9,11);font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">essaging about “purity” and ethical sourcing from producers in Pakistan.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(9,9,11);font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Claims of food‑grade quality with certifications and labeling (Kosher, Halal, Non‑GMO, gluten‑free) and emphasis on “microplastic‑free” natural ingredients.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: </p><ul style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;color:rgb(9,9,11);padding:0px 0px 0px 1.75rem;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);list-style:disc;font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Commission: e.g., 15% per referred sale; recurring on repeat orders if desired.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Tracking: use an affiliate platform or coupon codes/UTM links.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Payouts: monthly or twice‑monthly (e.g., 1st &amp; 15th after 30 days—matches your payment note) with minimum payout threshold and pay methods (PayPal/Venmo/Bank).</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Cookie window: 30 days.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Rules: permitted promotion channels, prohibited tactics (paid search on brand keywords, trademark use), and fraud prevention.</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: </p><ul style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;color:rgb(9,9,11);padding:0px 0px 0px 1.75rem;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);list-style:disc;font-family:Inter, 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Food creators &amp; chefs: recipe partnerships, video recipe demos showing finishing with pink/black salt.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Wellness/spa: promote coarse salt for baths and decorative uses products.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Retail &amp; foodservice: samples, bulk/pricing sheets, proposals for retailers and manufacturers.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Influencers &amp; affiliates: provide product images, sample kits, discount codes, pre‑written captions, and a commission dashboard.</li><li style=\"margin:12px 0px;color:inherit;padding:0px;border:0px solid rgb(228,228,231);\">Content marketing: blog posts (health/usage, origins), Instagram reels, and “how to use” short videos to drive conversions. (These align with site content emphasizing recipes/blog posts and Instagram presence.)</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
